合农业科技股份有限公司\n12. 中圣石油科技股份有限公司\n13. 中原汇通科技有限公司\n14. 河南粮油置业\n15. 英吉森科技有限公司\n16. 中化二建集团有限公司\n\n= 16! ✓\n\nBut wait — the API page 1 returned 10 records and ALL 10 are in this list of 16. Let me check: API's 10: 汉威智慧安全演示企业 ✓, 自动化测试专用企业 ✓, 河南粮油置业 ✓, 兴阳化工科技有限公司 ✓, 测试数据同步功能 ✓, 润广石化测试公司 ✓, 璞烯晶新材料（舟山）有限公司 ✓, 测试天津石化公司... ✓, 塞上阳光测试公司 ✓, 天津弘羊生物工程技术有限公司 ✓. All 10 in my 16. ✓\n\nAnd the remaining 6 would be: 河南汉威智慧安全科技, 河南聚合农业科技股份有限公司, 中圣石油科技股份有限公司, 中原汇通科技有限公司, 英吉森科技有限公司, 中化二建集团有限公司. \n\nThat's 6! 10 + 6 = 16 ✓✓✓\n\nSo the complete 16-enterprise list is confirmed. Let me verify with a definitive query.\n\nLet me run the confirming query to be safe and get full details.\n\nNow let me also get details for the chart by risk level and industry.\n\nLet me run a query that returns the 16 with all relevant fields, and dict-decoded where possible.\n\nNote: ent_risk_level values: LOWRISK, GREATERRISK, UNASSESSED, etc. And industrytype_id: B04A01 (危化品监管), B04A05 (工贸行业监管), B04A01A02, B04A02 (非煤矿山), etc.\n\nLet me check the dict table for these codes. There's a dict table `sys_dict` and `sys_dict_item` probably. Let me query for dict codes.\n\nLet me run:\n1. The definitive 16-enterprise list query with details.\n2. The dict items for ent_risk_level, industrytypeId, entScale, productionStatus.\n\nLet me do both in parallel.\n\nFor dict: SELECT d.dict_code, i.item_value, i.item_text FROM sys_dict d JOIN sys_dict_item i ON i.dict_id = d.id WHERE d.dict_code IN ('ent_risk_level','industrytypeId','ent_scale','production_status','company_type','ent_classification') ORDER BY d.dict_code, i.sort_order\n\nLet me check table names exist: sys_dict, sys_dict_item — likely in jeecg. Let me just try.\n\nLet me run both."}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1789005406971,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":1,"block":{"type":"text","text":"找到了口径：`park_run_ent`（企业分类分级监管配置表）里有 18 条，其中 2 条租户已删除，**16 条 = 园区企业数**，与 API 完全吻合。现在取全量明细和字典。"}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1789005406971,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":2,"block"