SSED → 未评估\n- industrytypeId_dictText: B04A01 → 危化品监管, B04A05 → 工贸行业监管, B04A01A02 → 危化品生产\n- entClassification_dictText: B14A01A01 → 危化品经营企业, B14A01A02 → 危化品生产企业, B14A01 → 危化行业, B14A02 → 非危化行业\n- productionStatus_dictText: 0 → 正常生产\n\nGood, I have those from the API observations. Let me try to get the exact dict for industrytypeId and entRiskLevel to be thorough. Let me search the dict table with a broader query.\n\nLet me query: SELECT d.dict_code, i.item_value, i.item_text FROM sys_dict d JOIN sys_dict_item i ON i.dict_id=d.id WHERE i.item_value IN ('B04A01','B04A05','B04A01A02','B14A01A01','B14A01A02','B14A01','B14A02','LOWRISK','GREATERRISK','UNASSESSED') \n\nLet me run that.\n\nActually, I already have the mappings from the API responses (dictText fields), which are authoritative. But let me confirm via dict to also catch any missing.\n\nLet me run it, and also build the chart.\n\nNow let me count for charts:\n\n16 enterprises:\n1. 中化二建集团有限公司 — risk null, industry null\n2. 中原汇通科技有限公司 — LOWRISK, industry null, company_type 02 危化品经营\n3. 中圣石油科技股份有限公司 — risk null, industry null, company_type 01 危化品生产\n4. 兴阳化工科技有限公司 — LOWRISK, B04A01A02 危化品生产, B14A01A02 危化品生产企业\n5. 塞上阳光测试公司 — LOWRISK, B04A05 工贸行业监管, B14A02 非危化行业\n6. 天津弘羊生物工程技术有限公司 — UNASSESSED, B04A05 工贸, B14A02 非危化\n7. 汉威智慧安全演示企业 — LOWRISK, B04A01 危化品监管, B14A01A01 危化品经营企业\n8. 河南汉威智慧安全科技 — UNASSESSED, B04A01 危化品监管, B14A01A01 危化品经营\n9. 河南粮油置业 — GREATERRISK, industry null, company_type 01 危化品生产\n10. 河南聚合农业科技股份有限公司 — UNASSESSED, B04A05 工贸, B14A02 非危化\n11. 测试天津石化公司... — LOWRISK, B04A01 危化品监管, B14A02 非危化行业\n12. 测试数据同步功能 — LOWRISK, B04A01 危化品监管, B14A01 危化行业\n13. 润广石化测试公司 — LOWRISK, B04A01A02 危化品生产, B14A01A01 危化品经营企业\n14. 璞烯晶新材料（舟山）有限公司 — LOWRISK, B04A01 危化品监管, B14A01A02 危化品生产\n15. 自动化测试专用企业 — LOWRISK, B04A01 危化品监管, B14A01A01 危化品经营\n16. 英吉森科技有限公司 — risk null, industry null\n\nRisk level distribution:\n- 低风险 LOWRISK: 中圣? no. Let me count: 中原汇通(LOWRISK), 兴阳化工(LOWRISK), 塞上阳光(LOWRISK), 汉威智慧安全演示企业(LOWRISK), 测试天津石化(LOWRISK), 测试数