r a table with 日报. Let me query information_schema.\n\nLet me also consider \"园区安全基础信息\" and \"园区总览\" for daily indicators.\n\nLet me start by searching tables.\n\nI'll run a few things in parallel:\n1. mysql_query for tables with 'daily'/'report'/'日报'\n2. query_module for 风险承诺公告 module (当日承诺公告) — that's part of daily safety reporting\n\nHmm, but let me first find whether there's an actual \"安全日报\" feature.\n\nLet me search the codebase? No, this is a remote API. Let me search the DB.\n\nLet me run the table search."}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1789005665574,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":1,"block":{"type":"text","text":"我先找一下\"安全日报\"在系统里的数据来源。"}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1789005665574,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":2,"block":{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_00_bjl38mdoAqvd6PfcBZuc6301","name":"mysql_query","arguments":"{\"sql\": \"SELECT table_name, table_comment FROM information_schema.tables WHERE table_schema='preprod_park' AND (table_name LIKE '%daily%' OR table_name LIKE '%report%' OR table_comment LIKE '%日报%' OR table_comment LIKE '%报告%') ORDER BY table_name\"}"}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1789005665574,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":3,"block":{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_01_uM51alP6mxEjpTNCfNuJ4872","name":"query_module","arguments":"{\"module_name\": \"风险承诺公告\", \"pageSize\": 10}"}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1789005665574,"chunk":{"type":"usage","usage":{"inputTokens":193,"outputTokens":522,"totalTokens":111947,"cacheReadTokens":111232,"reasoningTokens":363}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1789005665574,"chunk":{"type":"finish","reason":{"kind":"tool-calls"}}}]},"surfaceOp":"append"}
