56952 ≈ 56.69 years after 1970 → ~2026.7. More precisely: 1767225600 = 2026-01-01. 1789005661 - 1767225600 = 21780061 s = 252.08 days → ~2026-09-10. So \"now\" is about 2026-09-10/11.)\n\nSo 当日承诺公告统计 says 4 need to promise, 0 promised, 4 not. And latest commit was 2026-08-28.\n\n2. **隐患排查治理**（园区双重预防机制）\n3. **特殊作业**（当日特殊作业统计）\n4. **在线监测预警**（当日点位监测报警、当日视频智能分析报警）\n5. **人员分布管理**（在岗人员、违规报警）\n6. **开停车情况**\n\nLet me query these modules to build a \"安全日报\"-style analysis. That's the most useful interpretation.\n\nLet me query in parallel:\n- 园区双重预防机制 (隐患排查治理汇总)\n- 园区在线监测预警\n- 园区特殊作业管理\n- 人员分布管理\n- 企业巡检记录? \n\nLet me start with 3-4 modules in parallel.\n\nAlso check park_report_entdata for any data.\n\nLet me do:\n1. query_module 园区在线监测预警\n2. query_module 园区特殊作业管理\n3. query_module 园区双重预防机制\n4. mysql_query park_report_entdata count\n\nLet me run.\n\nActually query_module returns huge JSON. Let me be selective. But there's no way to select APIs. Let me do them one/two at a time to manage context.\n\nHmm, the previous 园区总览 returned a massive amount. Let me be careful. I'll do 2 at a time.\n\nLet me start with 园区在线监测预警 and 园区特殊作业管理 — both are core daily indicators.\n\nActually, let me reconsider: maybe there IS an API for 运行报告 (日报). Let me check the module list again... No \"运行报告\" module listed. The list has 园区总览, 园区双重预防机制, 园区在线监测预警, 园区安全基础信息, 园区封闭化管理, 园区敏捷应急, 园区特殊作业管理, 园区环保管理, 园区简介, 园区重大危险源.\n\nSo no report module. OK.\n\nGiven park_report is empty, the practical answer: 系统有安全日报（运行报告）功能，但当前环境未生成任何日报；我可以基于日报口径的实时数据做一份当日安全态势分析。\n\nLet me gather the data. Let me query modules.\n\nLet me do 园区在线监测预警 + 园区双重预防机制 first.\n\nHmm, these can be huge. Let me try one at a time, starting with 园区在线监测预警.\n\nActually, let me think about efficiency and context. Each returns ~50KB+. Doing 4 would be 200KB+. That's a lot but manageable? Risky.\n\nAlternative: query the DB directly for the daily metrics. That's much more compact. But mapping is harder.\n\nHmm. Let me use a hybrid: use the modules but accept the size. Let me do them in pairs.\n\nActually, let me reconsider — I could delegate the heavy module queries to subagents to save context! That's a good use. But subagents can't see my conversation; they'd need the tool list. They do have the same tools presumably. Hmm, but the module tool descriptions are in the system prompt — subagents should get the same system prompt with park API tools. That's plausible but uncertain.\n\nLet me just do it directly but efficiently: run 2 modules in parallel, and read the key numbers.\n\nLet me start with 园区在线监测预警 and 园区特殊作业管理."}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1789005677499,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":1,"block":{"type":"text","text":"系统里确实有\"安全日报\"表（`park_report`，type 1日报/2周报/3月报），但**当前环境 0 条记录**，还没生成过任何日报。我按安全日报的统计口径拉实时数据来做分析。"}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1789005677500,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":2,"block":{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_00_lAmZztvS631g0585qdun2868","name":"query_module","arguments":"{\"module_name\": \"园区在线监测预警\", \"pageSize\": 10}"}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1789005677500,"chunk":{"type":"usage","usage":{"inputTokens":1098,"outputTokens":1233,"totalTokens":117659,"cacheReadTokens":115328,"reasoningTokens":1117}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1789005677500,"chunk":{"type":"finish","reason":{"kind":"tool-calls"}}}]},"surfaceOp":"append"}
