ate=0 → 84 条, =1 → 10 条, =9 → 59 条.\n\nGiven acceptCount=59 = danger_state 9 = 已验收. And 84 = 待整改/整改中. 10 = ?\n\nLet me just query the dict. Let me search for dict items with item_value in ('9','0','1') and dict_code like '%state%' related to hidden.\n\nActually earlier dict query for '0' returned many codes. Let me query dict_code LIKE '%danger%' or '%hidden%'.\n\nLet me run one query: SELECT d.dict_code, i.item_value, i.item_text FROM sys_dict d JOIN sys_dict_item i ON i.dict_id=d.id WHERE d.dict_code LIKE '%danger%' OR d.dict_code LIKE '%hidden%' OR d.dict_code LIKE '%zg%'\n\nLet me do it. Also get 特殊作业 recent daily and 开停车/大检修 recent, and 预警 for park tenants.\n\nLet me batch 3 queries."}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1789007153543,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":1,"block":{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_00_AaNwJPZyyAyirRW51mmD5668","name":"mysql_query","arguments":"{\"sql\": \"SELECT d.dict_code, i.item_value, i.item_text FROM sys_dict d JOIN sys_dict_item i ON i.dict_id=d.id WHERE d.dict_code LIKE '%danger%' OR d.dict_code LIKE '%hidden%' OR d.dict_code LIKE '%rectif%' OR d.dict_code LIKE '%abarbeitung%' ORDER BY d.dict_code, i.sort_order\"}"}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1789007153543,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":2,"block":{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_01_Qb3nJYmvYcR80vl7cyR42323","name":"mysql_query","arguments":"{\"sql\": \"SELECT DATE(work_start_time) AS d, COUNT(*) AS work_cnt, SUM(CASE WHEN is_contractor_work='1' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS contractor_cnt, SUM(CASE WHEN is_cancel='1' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS cancelled FROM ent_special_work WHERE del_flag=0 AND work_start_time >= DATE_SUB(NOW(), INTERVAL 20 DAY) GROUP BY DATE(work_start_time) ORDER BY d DESC\"}"}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1789007153543,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":3,"block":{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_02_yh2IX1p0hZExh3qHJHU75529","name":"mysql_query","arguments":"{\"sql\": \"SELECT DATE(create_time) AS d, COUNT(*) AS cnt FROM h1_warn_event WHERE del_flag=0 AND tenant_id IN ('1907019009553