{"type":"assistant/message","seq":268,"time":1789007161047,"data":{"turn":5,"step":8,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"reasoning","text":"Now I have the correct dict:\n- hidden_danger_state: 0=未整改, 1=整改中, 9=已整改, 3=临期未整改, 4=超期未整改\n\nSo my danger_state values: 0 (84), 1 (10), 9 (59). Note: no 3 or 4 records in danger_state! But API reported 临期未整改 0, 超期未整改 36.\n\nHmm, danger_state 0=未整改 (84), 1=整改中 (10), 9=已整改 (59). Total 153 ✓\n\nBut the API's 隐患管控总统计 said: toBeRectifiedCount 73, overdueHiddenCount 59.\n\nHmm, and 隐患排查治理汇总 said: lqwzgCount 0 (临期未整改), yqwzgCount 67 (逾期未整改), zgzCount 84 (整改中), dysCount 10, yysCount 59 (已验收), dbCount 36 (待办).\n\nSo zgzCount 84 = 未整改 (danger_state 0) — API calls it 整改中? and dysCount 10 = 整改中 (danger_state 1)... names ambiguous. Anyway, the third-party API's own mapping: yysCount=59=已验收 matches danger_state 9=已整改. Good.\n\nLet me compute 逾期 properly: danger_state IN ('0','1') AND manage_deadline < NOW():\n- 0: 49 overdue\n- 1: 8 overdue\n= 57. Close to 59. Let me compute more precisely — maybe deadline <= NOW() or including '3','4'. Actually 49+8 = 57; API says overdueHiddenCount 59. Close enough; slight timing difference.\n\nActually let me recompute: danger_state='0' overdue 49, ='1' overdue 8 → 57. Hmm API 59. Minor. Let me just compute directly with a query to be accurate.\n\nLet me also get:\n- 开停车/大检修 recent\n- 特殊作业 ticket status / 抽查异常 \n- 隐患企业分布\n\nLet me run a final batch:\nQ1: 隐患 overdue precise + by enterprise\nQ2: 大检修/开车 recent\nQ3: 特殊作业 by type\n\nLet me run these 3.\n\nActually I have enough for a good analysis. Let me get a couple more precise numbers:\n\nQ1: SELECT SUM(CASE WHEN danger_state IN ('0','1') AND manage_deadline < NOW() THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS overdue_pending, SUM(CASE WHEN danger_state IN ('0','1') THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS pending, SUM(CASE WHEN danger_state='9' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS done, COUNT(*) AS total FROM ent_hidden_message WHERE del_flag=0\n\nQ2: SELECT hidden_ent/tenant, COUNT(*), SUM(重大) FROM ent_hidden_message GROUP BY tenant\n\nQ3: 大检修 + 开车 recent:\nSELECT '开车' t, MAX(create_time), COUNT(*) FROM ent_equipment_drive UNION ALL SELECT '大检修', MAX(create_time), COUNT(*) FROM ent_overhaul_manage\n\nLet me run.\n\nAlso 特殊作业 ticket_status distribution and 抽查异常.\n\nLet me run 3-4 queries in parallel."},{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_00_IowvsyFpe7EGwP2pVJqR2635","name":"mysql_query","arguments":"{\"sql\": \"SELECT COUNT(*) AS total, SUM(CASE WHEN danger_state IN ('0','1') THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS pending, SUM(CASE WHEN danger_state='9' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS done, SUM(CASE WHEN danger_state IN ('0','1') AND manage_deadline < NOW() THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS overdue_pending, SUM(CASE WHEN danger_state IN ('0','1') AND hidden_level='1' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS major_pending, ROUND(SUM(CASE WHEN danger_state='9' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END)/COUNT(*)*100,2) AS done_rate FROM ent_hidden_message WHERE del_flag=0\"}"},{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_01_qMz7EZQ1qID833ST7MBO7916","name":"mysql_query","arguments":"{\"sql\": \"SELECT tenant_id, COUNT(*) AS total, SUM(hidden_level='0') AS general, SUM(hidden_level='1') AS major, SUM(CASE WHEN danger_state IN ('0','1') THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS pending, SUM(CASE WHEN danger_state='9' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS done FROM ent_hidden_message WHERE del_flag=0 GROUP BY tenant_id ORDER BY total DESC\"}"},{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_02_YfZ85VZfkw1lBLWzTKxm5734","name":"mysql_query","arguments":"{\"sql\": \"SELECT '装置开车' AS t, MAX(create_time) AS last_time, COUNT(*) AS cnt FROM ent_equipment_drive UNION ALL SELECT '装置停车', MAX(create_time), COUNT(*) FROM ent_equipment_stop UNION ALL SELECT '大检修', MAX(create_time), COUNT(*) FROM ent_overhaul_manage UNION ALL SELECT '隐患整改记录', MAX(create_time), COUNT(*) FROM ent_hidden_abarbeitung_record UNION ALL SELECT '隐患排查记录', MAX(record_time), COUNT(*) FROM ent_hidden_record\"}"}],"source":{"kind":"model","provider":"deepseek-official","model":"deepseek-v4-flash"},"id":"3fa71af8-adde-4b20-a21e-caab21bdc984"},"usage":{"input